{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39408","headline":"芦苇 · 王贞白","name":"芦苇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高士想江湖，湖闲庭植芦。\n清风时有至，绿竹兴何殊。\n嫩喜日光薄，疎忧雨点麤。\n惊蛙跳得过，鬬雀袅如无。\n未织巴篱护，几擡邛竹扶。\n惹烟轻弱柳，蘸水漱清蒲。\n溉灌情偏重，琴樽赏不孤。\n穿花思钓叟，吹叶少羌雏。\n寒色暮天映，秋声远籁俱。\n郎吟应有趣，潇洒十余株。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}